  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "VRC seems to use some base value to determine what each viseme sound is supposed to be, this can be very bad for certain types of voices or enunciations due to accents or whatever.  \nThere should be something to tune visemes to match your voice, that is have it listen to you make the sound for each viseme and save it to your account.  Having accurate visemes would deepen social immersion. Personally, whenever i've been in an avatar that got some of the visemes accurate, the difference is night and day.",
